{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In the quiet sky, cube-shaped planets drift alone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">They may look the same\u2014but subtle differences tell deeper stories.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Rotate the planets, find the differences, and bring warmth to these lonely worlds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Cubeverse: The Lonely Planets</strong> is an emotional twist on the classic \u201cfind the difference\u201d game, reimagined in a beautiful 3D space.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3685180/extras/\u110f\u1172\u1107\u1173\u1107\u1165\u1109\u1173gif.gif?t=1745478184\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\ud83c\udf1f Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Rotate beautifully designed cube planets</strong> in full 3D</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Spot the differences</strong> between subtly varied versions of the same planet</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Artful and emotional visuals</strong>, from peaceful forests to glowing night skies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Unlock cute animal companions</strong> and helpful items</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Compete globally</strong> with leaderboards and scoring</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3685180?t=1745478184","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3685180?t=1745478184","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3685180/69a2411c7ca2542686b0f5e145eac0b691fdd874/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745478184","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3685180/69a2411c7ca2542686b0f5e145eac0b691fdd874/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745478184","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achi